  id: base_dread_summon_undead
  title: Summon undead
  description: 'This spell summons a group of undead around the caster to protect
    them. Their number and type are determined by rolling 1 red die.


    1 or 2
    = 4 skeletons.

    3 or 4 = 3 skeletons, 2 zombies.

    5 or 6 = 2 zombies,
    2 mummies.'
